            "title": "What size Net Return should I buy?",
            "answer": "<p>We want to ensure that your net fits your space perfectly. We recommend measuring your space and referring to the Minimum Room Dimensions listed in the product details section.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/compare\" title=\"Compare\">Find Your Fit</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_aWRHYT": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between the Home and Pro Series?",
            "answer": "<p>The <strong>Home Series</strong> and <strong>Pro Series</strong> nets share the same premium construction, including a durable aluminum frame, UV-protected polyester sleeve, and commercial-grade netting. The only difference is their sizes.</p><p><strong>Pro Series:</strong></p><p><strong>Pro</strong> - 8’ x 7’6 x 3’6</p><p><strong>Pro 8 </strong>- 8’ x 8’ x 3’6</p><p><strong>Pro 9</strong> - 9’ x 8’ x 3’6</p><p><strong>Pro 10</strong> - 10’ x 8’ x 3’6</p><p><strong>Pro XL</strong> - 10’ x 9’6 x 3’6</p><p><strong>Home Series: </strong></p><p><strong>Home</strong> - 7’ x 7’ x 3’6</p><p><strong>Mini</strong> - 5’ x 6’ x 3’6</p><p><strong>Junior</strong> - 4’6 x 4’6 x 2’4</p><p>The Pro Series has more size options for those needing a larger hitting area.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fzxXAb": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use my Net Return indoors or outdoors?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Net Returns are crafted for both indoor and outdoor settings, with the exception of the Simulator series. The Simulator series is meant exclusively for indoor golf simulation setups.</p><p>Our frames use 1.5’ tubular aluminum, powder coated for durability. The stainless-steel push buttons ensure longevity and reliable performance. Our netting and the UV-protected sleeve are made of 100% polyester, further enhancing the longevity of the product and making it suitable for outdoor use. Our accessories and turf are also suitable for indoor and outdoor use.</p><p>If you plan to leave your net outside permanently, we recommend using an <a href=\"https://www.thenetreturn.com/products/outdoor-cover\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">outdoor cover</span></a> for extra protection against harsh weather.</p>"
          }
        },
        "category_HGzcVH": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
